READING: M_core stays near 1/13 ONLY for small L1-distance to a dilated AP; larger
perturbation pushes M_core UP to >1/12 (loose, balance-safe). So near-tight => near-AP
(quantitative LRC13 stability), the ONE crux under the single-killer closed form.
Combined: generic core (M_core>1/12, s bounded) => balance>=14/183; near-tight => near-AP
=> shallow witness (stable, verified S71); exact tight => kps primitivity s=1. SINGLE-KILLER
closed-form reduces to proving quantitative LRC13 stability (a clean isolated statement).
